no panisiaan yo ra si juan so elias a nipasakbay ya onsabi
tinepet nen pilato sikay ari da ray judio sika lan dili so mangibabaga ebat nen jesus
a linmad tawen ta n manyodyorung ed nikawanay dios manooley diman ed saray anghil tan saray mangatatawen a pakayari tan pakaoley
