no nipatnag so kagalangay d ios ed panamegley to say dios met sirin ipatnag ton tampol so kagalangay anak na too
ta agagik imbalitad siak na saray totoo nen cloe a wala rad sikayoy mankokolkol
mampuyat tan mampikasi kayo pian ag kayo napelag ed tukso sipaparaan so ispiritu balet makapoy so laman
